          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Consequently every $\\sim_c$-fiber is the closed interval $$[w]_c=\\{y\\in W:\\pi_c(w)\\le_Ry\\le_Ru_c(w)\\}$$ with lower endpoint $\\pi_c(w)$ and upper endpoint $u_c(w)$: no fiber has a gap, both endpoint maps are order preserving",
